        "notes": "Legendary loadout and Ability power is what your main focus is. With this build you will easily take out anyone with 1 round of missiles or add a quick boost and melee to finish them off. Take the high ground. Single out targets and kill them. If you have an aggressive tank like rein protect party from him and dispatch him first. Beware of mercy trying to get a res. Guard the body of the tank and go after her ASAP if she comes for it. \n\nOtherwise use the divebomb strat. Fly high. Find a single target then bombard. Use matrix to keep alive and boost out asap. Rinse and repeat. You should be walking out with 12-16k easily.",
