        "created_at": "2025-07-15T23:56:34.111975+00:00",
        "notes": "Here is where it starts really getting fun! Get the Overstocked double missile build! Mastermind Mitigator is amazing! When using matrix you almost instantly get back another silo of missiles. At this point you are a rocket launching machine! If you have extra cash which you should throw in all the ability powers you can Epics first! Onslaught Ordinance or Catalytic Crystal if you can afford over Nano Cola. \n\nSame strat as before except if they have armor and are barely surviving your first missile silo you now how 2 to finish the job every time! After your kill play back with healers and team till you have 2 silos up again use matrix to absorb and build them up faster. Make sure to let matrix fill before next dive. Try to target the easy players like Ash/Zen/Soldier or anyone that cant get away easily. If you are fighting with a moira she will probably fade out the first silo but just use your boost and 2nd silo to finish her off. Mei if she uses cryo freeze wait a second fly high and dive bomb her so she doesn't wall you off during a silo barrage.",
